Rosalind,<br />
<br />
Conflicts have cleared and I am pleased to attach our engagement letter. As=
 we discussed, the firm will represent Torvane Industrial Group, Inc. in co=
nnection with claims arising out of the Kelling Station Unit 2 expansion pr=
oject. Our matter number is 2011-0284; please use it on correspondence with=
 our accounting department.<br />
<br />
The letter reflects the rate schedule we agreed on the phone, with my time =
at the industrial-disputes rate and Caleb Wisner staffed as the senior asso=
ciate. If the terms are acceptable, please countersign and return a copy at=
 your convenience.<br />
<br />
We have a lot of ground to cover before a demand goes out. I suggest we get=
 the project record moving to us this week - the EPC agreement and amendmen=
ts, the commissioning logs, and the correspondence file with Ridgeline from=
 January 2010 forward.<br />
<br />
Regards,<br />
<br />
Arthur Pellum<br />
Prescott Vane LLP<br />
Pittsburgh
